---
title: Checkout
---
flowchart TD
    A[Customer opens cart] --> B{Logged in?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Load saved address]
    B -->|No| D[Ask for email]
    D --> E[Create guest session]
    E --> C
    C --> F{Payment ok?}
    F -->|Yes| G([Order placed])
    F -->|No| H[Show error]
    H -.-> C
    classDef hot fill:#f96
    class G hot
